    "Two-year MBA with a flexible core, majors, electives and individual career advising.": "兩年制 MBA，設彈性核心課程、主修、選修及個人職涯諮詢。",
    "Flexible full-time MBA with concentrations spanning analytic finance, behavioral science, business analytics and other disciplines.": "彈性全日制 MBA，專修包括分析金融、行為科學、商業分析等領域。",
    "Compare the Two-Year MBA here; the One-Year, MBAi and MMM formats have different structures and costs.": "此處比較兩年制 MBA；一年制、MBAi 及 MMM 的結構及費用不同。",
    "Two-year MBA with a shared first-year Required Curriculum and FIELD, followed by electives. The case method emphasizes decisions under incomplete information.": "兩年制 MBA，第一年共修必修課及 FIELD，之後選修。個案教學強調在資訊不完整時作決策。",
    "Full-time MBA; tuition and its mandatory MBA program fee are published together.": "全日制 MBA；公布學費包括必繳 MBA 課程費。",
    "MBA program; use the August-entry route for a Fall 2027 comparison and verify its internship calendar separately.": "MBA 課程；比較 2027 年秋季入學時應使用八月入學途徑，並另行核實實習時間表。",
    "Two-Year Full-time MBA; keep it separate from Stern’s specialized and part-time MBAs.": "兩年制全日制 MBA；須與 Stern 的專門及兼讀 MBA 分開。",
    "Full-time MBA academic experience; curriculum details and faculty mapping remain to be verified.": "全日制 MBA 學術體驗；詳細課程及教師專長對應仍待核實。",
    "Full-time MBA; use this program’s requirements rather than the evening/weekend or executive formats.": "全日制 MBA；應使用此課程的要求，而非晚間／週末或高階管理形式。",
    "Integrated core organized around organizational stakeholders, with attention to business and society.": "核心課程以組織持份者為中心整合，關注商業與社會。",
    "Full-time MBA academic route; curriculum and experiential-learning details are linked for deeper comparison.": "全日制 MBA 學術途徑；已附課程及實踐學習來源供深入比較。",
    "All first-year MBAs take MAP: a seven-week, real-company consulting project.": "所有一年級 MBA 學生須參與 MAP：為真實企業進行的七週顧問專案。",
    "Daytime MBA with 13 required core classes and more than 100 electives; general management with room to customize.": "日間 MBA 設 13 門必修核心課程及超過 100 門選修，結合綜合管理與個人化選擇。",
    "Core business study and a second-semester immersion prepare students for a required summer internship. Second-year electives allow customization.": "核心商學及第二學期沉浸式學習，為必修暑期實習作準備。第二年可透過選修調整方向。",
    "Analytics and decision-making combined with leadership coaching, consulting projects and experiential study.": "分析與決策結合領導力指導、顧問專案及實踐學習。",
    "Core and career-focused electives are completed before internships; concentrations and emphases customize the degree.": "實習前完成核心及職涯導向選修；可透過專修領域與重點調整學位內容。",
    "Core business foundations followed by substantial customization: more than 70% of coursework is self-selected.": "核心商學基礎後可大幅自訂：超過 70% 課程由學生自行選擇。",
    "Elective specializations and a capstone field study support applied learning. Students can pursue a client project or a Business Creation Capstone.": "選修專修領域及畢業實地專案支援應用學習；可選客戶專案或創業畢業專案。",
    "Two-year, 88-credit full-time MBA with an integrated first-year core and second-year electives.": "兩年制、88 學分全日制 MBA，第一年修讀整合核心，第二年選修。",
    "Integrated core and Career Foundation Academies with company-based consulting projects. The +Flex pathway permits second-year completion on campus or online; international visa implications need checking.": "整合核心課程、職涯學院及企業顧問專案。+Flex 可於第二年選擇實體或網上修讀；國際學生簽證影響須確認。",
    "Full-time MBA; verify curriculum and career outcomes for the residential format.": "全日制 MBA；須按實體形式核實課程及職涯成果。",
    "Two-Year MBA with early career preparation, performance coaching and quantitative/AI foundations.": "兩年制 MBA 提供早期職涯準備、表現指導及量化／人工智能基礎。",
    "53-credit cohort MBA over 18–21 months, beginning in July. Daytime core and evening electives; confirm the exact 2027 start rather than assuming a September intake.": "53 學分同屆班制 MBA，修讀 18–21 個月，七月開課。核心課於日間、選修於晚間；須確認 2027 年實際開課日，不應假設九月入學。",
    "Two-year in-person MBA with a Career Launchpad immersion featuring coaching, pitch training and networking preparation.": "兩年制實體 MBA，Career Launchpad 沉浸活動包括指導、簡報訓練及人脈準備。",
    "First-semester core followed by concentration electives and applied capstones; pre-arrival academic and career preparation.": "首學期核心課程後修讀專修選修及應用畢業專案；入學前提供學術與職涯準備。",
    "Full-time MBA core plus electives and 14 STEM-designated concentration options.": "全日制 MBA 核心及選修課程，另設 14 個 STEM 專修選項。",
    "67-credit MBA with first-year core courses and 12 specializations; substantial elective choice.": "67 學分 MBA，第一年核心課程及 12 個專修領域，提供充足選修選擇。",
    "Data analytics, executive mentoring and team-based Experiential Learning Labs are built into the full-time MBA.": "全日制 MBA 融合資料分析、高階主管導師及團隊實踐學習實驗室。",
    "First-year core followed by more than 100 elective choices, spanning analytics, finance, strategy and other business disciplines.": "第一年核心課程後可從超過 100 門選修中選擇，涵蓋分析、金融、策略等商學領域。",
