    "Graduate School of Engineering quarterly rate for 11–18 units is $23,239 (2026–27). Three academic-year quarters (Autumn–Spring) = $69,717. 8–10 units is $15,100/quarter. Per-unit above 18: $1,549. MS CS requires 45 units; HCP/online uses a different per-unit schedule. Living costs and Cardinal Care are separate.": "工程學研究生院 11–18 學分季度費率為 $23,239（2026–27）。三個學年學季（秋–春）合計 $69,717。8–10 學分為 $15,100/季。超過 18 學分每學分 $1,549。MS CS 需 45 學分；HCP/線上課程另有每學分費率。生活費及 Cardinal Care 另計。",
    "Registrar Master of Engineering (All M.Eng Degrees) per-semester continuing totals: residents $29,767.75; nonresidents $36,883.25 (includes tuition, Student Services Fee, campus/transit fees, PDST $16,850 resident / $17,843 nonresident, NRST $6,122.50 for nonresidents, IREF, and health insurance $4,103). Program is Fall+Spring only → nonresident AY $73,766.50. New students add $119 document fee in first semester ($37,002.25 first-semester nonresident total).": "教務處 MEng（所有 M.Eng 學位）每學期續讀生合計：州內 $29,767.75；州外 $36,883.25（含學費、學生服務費、校園/交通費、PDST 州內 $16,850／州外 $17,843、州外 NRST $6,122.50、IREF 及健康保險 $4,103）。課程僅秋春兩季 → 州外每學年 $73,766.50。新生首學期另加 $119 文件費（州外首學期合計 $37,002.25）。",
    "Registrar: Engineering and Engineering Related Programs (including Computer Science) — Nonresident or International Range I (12+ hours) $20,222/semester ($40,444 AY Fall+Spring). Resident Range I $10,636/semester ($21,272 AY). Range II (6–11 hours) nonresident/international $13,482/semester ($26,964 AY); Illinois Cost Calculator for MCS international at 9 credits matches Range II. Campus fees and living costs are extra. Online MCS uses a different per-credit schedule—not recorded here.": "教務處：工程及相關課程（含計算機科學）— 州外或國際 Range I（12+ 學分）$20,222/學期（秋春每學年 $40,444）。州內 Range I $10,636/學期（每學年 $21,272）。Range II（6–11 學分）州外/國際 $13,482/學期（每學年 $26,964）；伊利諾州 MCS 國際生 9 學分計算器與 Range II 一致。校園費及生活費另計。線上 MCS 另有每學分費率—未記於此。",
    "Bursar: Endowed Research Master’s (M.S. and listed M.A./non-degree) $14,750/semester, $29,500/year (2026–27). CS MS admitted students receive full tuition, stipend, and health insurance via required TA-ships each of four semesters—so billed tuition is typically covered for admitted students. Separately, M.Eng is Professional Tier 1: $36,973/semester, $73,946/year (self-supported).": "學生財務處：捐贈基金研究型碩士（M.S. 及所列 M.A./非學位）$14,750/學期、$29,500/年（2026–27）。CS MS 錄取生四個學期均需擔任 TA，可獲全額學費、津貼及健康保險—故錄取生應繳學費通常已涵蓋。另：M.Eng 為專業 Tier 1：$36,973/學期、$73,946/年（自費）。",
    "Bursar 2026–27 Atlanta campus graduate Master & PhD Candidates: In-State $7,280/semester (12+ hrs) or $607/hr (1–11); Out-of-State $16,073/semester (12+) or $1,341/hr; Out-of-Country $16,540/semester (12+) or $1,379/hr. International-relevant figure uses Out-of-Country full-time: $16,540 × 2 = $33,080 AY. Mandatory student fees $608/semester at 4+ credits not included in the tuition figure. OMSCS ($227/hr) is excluded.": "學生財務處 2026–27 亞特蘭大校區碩士及博士：州內 $7,280/學期（12+ 學分）或 $607/學時（1–11）；州外 $16,073/學期（12+）或 $1,341/學時；境外 $16,540/學期（12+）或 $1,379/學時。國際生參考採境外全職：$16,540 × 2 = 每學年 $33,080。4+ 學分強制學生費 $608/學期未含於學費數字。OMSCS（$227/學時）未列入。",
    "Graduate Nonresident Natural Sciences: 9 semester hours = $9,081 per semester → $18,162 for Fall+Spring. At 12 hours: $10,970/semester. Separately, the catalog lists Option III Computer Science (MSCompSci) total program fee estimate $10,000 (same resident/nonresident)—commonly associated with the online/CDSO pathway. Confirm with UTCS which schedule applies to a specific on-campus research MS offer.": "研究生州外自然科學：9 學分 = $9,081/學期 → 秋春合計 $18,162。12 學分：$10,970/學期。另：目錄列 Option III 計算機科學（MSCompSci）整體課程費估計 $10,000（州內/州外相同）— 常與線上/CDSO 途徑相關。請向 UTCS 確認特定校內研究型 MS 錄取適用哪套費率。",
    "Registrar College of Engineering Graduate Full Term 2026–27: Michigan Non-Resident 9+ (Full-Time) $34,019 per full term; Michigan Resident $18,308. Typical academic year = Fall + Winter full terms → nonresident $68,038. CSE MS/MSE uses Engineering graduate rates. Master’s funding is not guaranteed at admission.": "教務處工程學院研究生全學期 2026–27：密西根州外 9+（全職）每全學期 $34,019；州內 $18,308。典型學年 = 秋、冬全學期 → 州外 $68,038。CSE MS/MSE 採工程研究生費率。碩士資助於入學時不保證。",
    "UCSD Graduate Registration Fees 2026–27: California Nonresidents annual total $38,087.17 (includes systemwide tuition $13,722, Student Services Fee $1,344, campus fees, mandatory health insurance $6,660, and Nonresident Supplemental Tuition $15,102). California Residents annual total $22,985.17. CSE MS uses the standard graduate schedule (not self-supporting). One-time Enrollment Services Fee $115 is included in the published Fall/annual nonresident total. International visa administration fee $200 is separate.": "UCSD 2026–27 研究生註冊費：加州州外每年合計 $38,087.17（含系統學費 $13,722、學生服務費 $1,344、校園費、強制健康保險 $6,660、州外補充學費 $15,102）。州內每年 $22,985.17。CSE MS 採標準研究生費率（非自費項目）。一次性入學服務費 $115 已含於公布的秋季/州外年度總額。國際簽證行政費 $200 另計。"
